      "writtenOn": "2018-10-31T22:15:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As discussed offline, for dev images, the second RO slot is not filled in, and gets -1.-1.-1 as a version. Ex:\nRO_A:4919.0.0 RW_A:0.4.10[00000000:00000000:00000000] RO_B:-1.-1.-1 RW_B:0.4.10[00000000:00000000:00000000]\n\nWe could check for that and alwasy allow RO_B\u003d-1.-1.-1, but instead for simplicity I suggest removing the A\u003d\u003dB check completely, even for -M case. Just print the versions from slot A for -M w/o verifying that slot B is the same. If \u0026 when we have reasons to check A\u003d\u003dB, we can add a better logic.",
      "parentUuid": "29b0c6b7_b50d397d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1404,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1412,
